      "event_type": "approval_requested",
      "class": "ApprovalRequested",
      "doc": "图已挂起，等待人工确认。\n\n前端收集答复后调用 `AgentRuntime.resume(thread_id, {request_id: bool})`。\n若事件流以本事件收尾（而不是 RunFinished），即表示处于挂起状态。",
