    {
      "event_type": "plan_created",
      "class": "PlanCreated",
      "doc": "planner 完成分解。\n\n`degraded` 为真表示**规划其实失败了**：模型没给出可解析的步骤，\n已退化成「整条请求当成一步」。这时 `steps` 只有一项、就是请求原文，\n后面不会再有真正的多步推进。前端必须把它显示出来 ——\n静默降级的话，一次完全失效的规划看起来和正常工作一模一样。",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "steps",
          "type": "list[str]",
          "default": "Field(default_factory=list)",
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "kinds",
          "type": "list[str]",
          "default": "Field(default_factory=list)",
          "doc": "与 steps 逐项对齐：explore / implement / verify / unknown"
        },
        {
          "name": "degraded",
          "type": "bool",
          "default": false,
          "doc": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "event_type": "plan_revised",
      "class": "PlanRevised",
      "doc": "执行中重建了剩余计划（planner 只在开局跑一次，之后靠它修正）。\n\n`steps` 是**完整的**新计划（含已完成的部分，它们不会被改动），\n`step_idx` 是当前所处步骤，前端据此重新渲染计划面板。\n修订次数有硬上限（`AGENT_MAX_REPLANS`）。",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "steps",
          "type": "list[str]",
          "default": "Field(default_factory=list)",
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "kinds",
          "type": "list[str]",
          "default": "Field(default_factory=list)",
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "step_idx",
          "type": "int",
          "default": 0,
          "doc": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "event_type": "repair_started",
      "class": "RepairStarted",
      "doc": "验证失败后开始第 N 次修复。",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "attempt",
          "type": "int",
          "default": 1,
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "limit",
          "type": "int",
          "default": 0,
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "summary",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "",
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "issues",
          "type": "list[str]",
          "default": "Field(default_factory=list)",
          "doc": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "event_type": "review_finished",
      "class": "ReviewFinished",
      "doc": "一步做完、验证通过后，代码审查的结果。\n\n与 `Verification` 分开而不是复用：审查回答的不是「行为对不对」，而是\n「代码干不干净」（调试残留、被改弱的断言、语法坏掉的分支、往 `.agent/` 里写）。\n合成一个事件会让「这一步到底卡在哪一关」看不出来。\n\nstatus: clean / warned / blocked / skipped",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "status",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "skipped",
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "blocked",
          "type": "bool",
          "default": false,
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "summary",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "",
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "findings",
          "type": "list[str]",
          "default": "Field(default_factory=list)",
          "doc": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "event_type": "run_failed",
      "class": "RunFailed",
      "doc": "编排层自身出错（模型/沙箱不可用等），与「工具执行失败」不同。\n\n同样带上已累计的用量：失败的那一轮**花费可能最多**（反复重试、长上下文），\n把它排除在统计外会让成本口径系统性偏低。",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "message",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "",
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "input_tokens",
          "type": "int | None",
          "default": null,
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "output_tokens",
          "type": "int | None",
          "default": null,
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "worker_input_tokens",
          "type": "int | None",
          "default": null,
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "worker_output_tokens",
          "type": "int | None",
          "default": null,
          "doc": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "event_type": "run_finished",
      "class": "RunFinished",
      "doc": "一轮运行正常收尾。\n\n`input_tokens` / `output_tokens` 是整轮的用量总计（跨挂起-恢复累加），\n取自 provider 回报的 `usage_metadata`。未回报时为 None —— 与 0 不同，\n消费方（如能力评测）不该把缺失当成\"用了零 token\"。",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "thread_id",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "",
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "answer",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "",
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "input_tokens",
          "type": "int | None",
          "default": null,
          "doc": "主 agent 的 run_total（含委派子智能体，runtime 会并入）。"
        },
        {
          "name": "output_tokens",
          "type": "int | None",
          "default": null,
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "worker_input_tokens",
          "type": "int | None",
          "default": null,
          "doc": "编排 worker 的用量。dispatch 不把 worker 并进 run_total，必须单列； 前端要显示总成本时自行相加。"
        },
        {
          "name": "worker_output_tokens",
          "type": "int | None",
          "default": null,
          "doc": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "concurrency",
          "type": "list[dict] | None",
          "default": null,
          "doc": "本次运行的资源池快照（worker/tool/wsl/llm 的并发、排队与等待时间）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "event_type": "run_started",
      "class": "RunStarted",
      "doc": "一轮运行开始。前端用它标记事件流的起点（Web SSE 的第一帧）。",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "thread_id",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "",
          "doc": ""
        }
