    {
      "event_type": "steering_applied",
      "class": "SteeringApplied",
      "doc": "一条用户干预指令被图节点消费。\n\naction: pause | resume | cancel | add | replan。\npause 在 `interrupt()` 时发出（事件流到此收尾，等待\n`AgentRuntime.resume_steering`）；其余动作在节点更新时发出。",
